  AUTHORS   Kramer,P.R. and Wray,S.
  TITLE     Novel gene expressed in nasal region influences outgrowth of
            olfactory axons and migration of luteinizing hormone-releasing
            hormone (LHRH) neurons
  JOURNAL   Genes Dev 14 (14), 1824-1834 (2000)
   PUBMED   10898796
REFERENCE   10 (bases 1 to 3643)
  AUTHORS   Balasubramanian,R. and Crowley,W.F. Jr.
  TITLE     Isolated Gonadotropin-Releasing Hormone (GnRH) Deficiency
  JOURNAL   (in) Adam MP, Bick S, Mirzaa GM, Pagon RA, Wallace SE and Amemiya A
            (Eds.);
            GENEREVIEWS(R);
